<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.8 points to 820.0.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.8 points to 820.0.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 2.8 points on Thursday to 820.0, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the construction index losing the most, down 1.69 percent to 976.1 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
